    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="49f94da9-0303-5db4-a9cc-dddd723fc317" activityNameId="b89555fb-473d-5b0c-843d-a71f34066cc1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Plant onshore, natural gas, production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Plant onshore, natural gas, production
Construction and dismantling of an onshore production field with 100 wells. Life time 20 years.;
0d4fd0d8-b50d-32d6-84ed-3c1ba80bf901
Materials for construction, energy use for construction. Land use and transformation. Wells are not included and are considered separately. Manufacturing of facilities partly not included.
Location:  Data for fields in RU, US and multinational companies.
Technology: Onshore crude oil production in the Northern hemisphere.
Time period: Data for materials and land use based on information from 1990. Data for energy and material uses during construction from 2007. New assumption for life time.
Production volume: Unknown.
Sampling: Publication in environmental reports and other literature.
Extrapolations: Applied on all onshore operations. Data vary considerably depending on infrastructure necessary to access the place. No data for Middle East.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0d4fd0d8-b50d-32d6-84ed-3c1ba80bf901.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
